        "text": "Page: Armageddon: A Novel of Berlin. Sentence: Armageddon, or Armageddon: A Novel of Berlin, is a novel by Leon Uris about post-World War II Berlin and Germany.\nPage: Armageddon: A Novel of Berlin. Sentence: The description of the Berlin Airlift is quite vivid as is the inter-action between people of the five nations involved as the three major Western Allies rub along with the Soviet occupiers of East Berlin and East Germany.\nPage: Leon Uris. Sentence: Leon Marcus Uris (August 3, 1924 – June 21, 2003) was an American author, known for his historical fiction.\nPage: Leon Uris. Sentence: His two bestselling books were \"Exodus\" (published in 1958) and \"Trinity\" (published in 1976).",
